      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s name comes from Cherokee trader George Fields, who ran a trading post at the crossroads of Georgetown Road and Francisco Road in the early 1800s.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
